{"unit_id":"QingJ01__dsh-prompt-prediction#card-zh","repo":"QingJ01/dsh-prompt-prediction","commit":"50a339fc518cc29fd615caa92c428e7f9496a24d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Prompt Prediction 是一个面向 DSH 网页端的提示词预测插件。它在 Agent 完成回复后请求当前会话所用模型，预测用户可能发送的下一句话，并将结果作为输入框中的灰色幽灵文本展示。用户可以按 Tab 或右方向键把建议填入可编辑草稿，也可以忽略或关闭建议；插件不会自动发送内容。预测仅用于普通会话，可在设置中调整启用状态、预测长度、超时和日志选项。适合希望减少重复输入、同时保留发送前检查机会的 DSH 用户。使用前需要会话已有可用模型路由，不需要额外账号配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:277-290","lib/client.js:514-545","cordis.patch.yml:7-19"]}
{"unit_id":"QingJ01__dsh-prompt-prediction#card-en","repo":"QingJ01/dsh-prompt-prediction","commit":"50a339fc518cc29fd615caa92c428e7f9496a24d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Prompt Prediction predicts a likely next message after an agent reply and shows ghost text in the DSH web composer. Press Tab or ArrowRight to insert it as an editable draft; it is never sent automatically. It uses the session model route and supports adjustable limits, timeouts, and local logs.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:277-290","lib/client.js:514-545","cordis.patch.yml:7-19"]}
