{"unit_id":"QingJ01__dsh-prompt-prediction#feature-1","repo":"QingJ01/dsh-prompt-prediction","commit":"50a339fc518cc29fd615caa92c428e7f9496a24d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Prompt Prediction 的功能「下一句幽灵文本」：会话回复完成后，插件请求模型预测用户可能输入的后续消息，并将第一段显示在空输入框中；预测结果不是已发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:404-425","lib/client.js:611-615"]}
